// Melodic habits measured from the VGMusic corpus (D52).
//
// GENERATED by scripts/import-vgmusic.mjs — do not hand-edit.
//
// NOT TUNES. D30 ruled that "extracting the melody of X would be copying a
// tune, not abstracting a habit", and that ruling stands: nothing in this file
// is a sequence of notes. What is here is a DISTRIBUTION — how often the line
// steps or leaps, whether leaps reverse, how wide it ranges, how many onsets a
// bar carries, which rhythm cells recur. It is the same artifact
// melody-profiles.js already carries for toby-fox, whose numbers came from
// 37,464 measured intervals of the Undertale import.
//
// TWO FILTERS decide what contributes. Only songs whose melody was separable
// by TRACK (splitHands() falls back to a pitch split on single-track files, and
// that fallback cannot be trusted to have found a tune) — and then only those
// whose melody stream is not an ARPEGGIO CHANNEL. Game MIDI routinely puts a
// fast broken-chord part above the melody; measuring it unfiltered gave 9
// onsets a bar and 90% bar-rhythm repetition, an ostinato's fingerprint.
// 364 songs separable, 241 of them a tune.
//
// NOT ALL FIELDS ARE COMPARABLE to the toby-fox profile. The interval shares,
// upBias, leapRecovery and stepInertia are measured the same way and do line
// up closely (step .32 vs .34, octave .061 vs .066) — two corpora measured
// independently agreeing is the reason to believe either. But
// `cellRepetitionFloor` here counts any bar whose rhythm signature occurs more
// than once in the song, which saturates its 0.9 cap on almost anything
// repetitive; toby-fox's 0.5 was a hand-set audition default, not that
// measurement. Do not read the two side by side.

export const MELODY_PROFILE_VGMUSIC = {
  'game-midi': {
    moves: { repeat: 0.2, step: 0.323, third: 0.214, fourth: 0.091, fifth: 0.059, sixth: 0.028, octave: 0.061 },
    upBias: 0.533,
    leapRecovery: 0.71,
    stepInertia: 0.559,
    rangeSteps: 13,
    cellRepetitionFloor: 0.9,
    onBeatShare: 0.383,
    onsetsPerBar: 5,
    legatoShare: 0.671,
    staccatoShare: 0.175,
    // carried from the toby-fox profile: these are not measurable from
    // interval statistics and stay audition-tunable defaults (D37).
    approachProb: 0.15, chromaticApproach: 0.25, tensions: 'triadic',
  },
};

